# Dependencies and build products are created by the Docker build.
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/**
**/dist
**/dist/**
**/coverage
**/coverage/**
**/data
**/data/**
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm

# Never include local secrets or repository history in Docker context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
.git/**
.github
.github/**

# Browser test artifacts and local caches.
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.cache
**/.DS_Store
